  "fullDescription": "JUST BROWSING? CHECK OUT MY ENTIRE SHOP – CREATIVE WOLF DESIGN\n\nThis is a set of 12 Christmas Elements Digital Paper patterns, perfect for the holiday season.\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality.\n\nThis set includes festive patterns with ornaments, branches and leaves, berries, mistletoe, christmas trees, lights and ornaments, as well as lettering and polka dots designs.\n\nThe cute patterns in shades of red, emerald green and navy and light blue are perfect for the Holiday season and allow you to easily mix and match them for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.\n\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (96 MB) and includes:\n\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels\n\n* 12 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n* 12 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing\n\n* BONUS 16 washi tapes in PNG and TIFF (both transparent background)\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For better results, use the JPEG or TIFF files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings\n\n– MATCHING CLIPART SET IN MY SHOP! –\n\nThank you for stopping by!",
